e the copy constructor of all container types to explicit (except Vector).\r\n* Fix all of the places where that broke compiling things, including manually checking if we really need to copy there.\r\n* Keep only the changes that avoid copying.\r\n* Discard the changes that make copying explicit and return the copy constructors to normal.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes behavior by avoiding copies, which *should* only improve performance with no negative consequences. For each change I checked if it was good. However, it is perfectly possible that I made mistakes.\r\n\r\nAfter this PR, we can follow-up with either making the copy constructor explicit or adding `duplicate`, see the discussion in PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107377 for more information.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu